    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Toon</strong> is a colorful single-player game where you'll venture through the pages of a living comic book. Use your wits and various onomatopoeias to overcome different challenges, all in the hope of escaping the book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6fa1ebcff9c110d45a2db56e5d952332.avif?t=1748543685\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6424d064754167a705d976bdf6511d2c.poster.avif?t=1748543685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6424d064754167a705d976bdf6511d2c.webm?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6424d064754167a705d976bdf6511d2c.mp4?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the different levels found within the comic\u2019s pages, full of panels, obstacles, and enemies that get in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/4d0a9800b9e89c5db50c93ccf26c4ded.avif?t=1748543685\" data-has-big width=800 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/e0eb199e804f0e7d41d3fb0146b1e473.poster.avif?t=1748543685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/e0eb199e804f0e7d41d3fb0146b1e473.webm?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/e0eb199e804f0e7d41d3fb0146b1e473.mp4?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome these obstacles by using a variety of onomatopoeias \u2014 from blowing up walls, jumping over them, or even electrocuting your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9a03caf52c2dc526e381b3e7dedb460f.avif?t=1748543685\" data-has-big width=800 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9364d75508c9fa4c20f85a20e1c679d5.poster.avif?t=1748543685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9364d75508c9fa4c20f85a20e1c679d5.webm?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9364d75508c9fa4c20f85a20e1c679d5.mp4?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's story will gradually unfold beneath the player\u2019s feet. As the player collects the three primary colors scattered throughout each level, the drawings will slowly fill with color.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Toon</strong> is a colorful single-player game where you'll venture through the pages of a living comic book. Use your wits and various onomatopoeias to overcome different challenges, all in the hope of escaping the book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6fa1ebcff9c110d45a2db56e5d952332.avif?t=1748543685\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6424d064754167a705d976bdf6511d2c.poster.avif?t=1748543685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6424d064754167a705d976bdf6511d2c.webm?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/6424d064754167a705d976bdf6511d2c.mp4?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the different levels found within the comic\u2019s pages, full of panels, obstacles, and enemies that get in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/4d0a9800b9e89c5db50c93ccf26c4ded.avif?t=1748543685\" data-has-big width=800 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/e0eb199e804f0e7d41d3fb0146b1e473.poster.avif?t=1748543685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/e0eb199e804f0e7d41d3fb0146b1e473.webm?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/e0eb199e804f0e7d41d3fb0146b1e473.mp4?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome these obstacles by using a variety of onomatopoeias \u2014 from blowing up walls, jumping over them, or even electrocuting your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9a03caf52c2dc526e381b3e7dedb460f.avif?t=1748543685\" data-has-big width=800 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9364d75508c9fa4c20f85a20e1c679d5.poster.avif?t=1748543685\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9364d75508c9fa4c20f85a20e1c679d5.webm?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773960/extras/9364d75508c9fa4c20f85a20e1c679d5.mp4?t=1748543685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's story will gradually unfold beneath the player\u2019s feet. As the player collects the three primary colors scattered throughout each level, the drawings will slowly fill with color.</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape Toon is a 3D puzzle-adventure game for a single player, where you\u2019ll explore the pages of a living comic book. Use onomatopoeias to break walls, jump over obstacles, electrocute enemies, and unlock panels as you uncover a story beneath your feet.",
